* *"Now that discovery is closed, what is the exact timeline of events leading up to the hearing?"*
* *"Will we do a 'mock cross-examination' or practice run before the actual hearing date?"*
* *"Who else will be testifying at this hearing? Are there any expert witnesses or third parties?"*

